H241.definition:
from H238 (אָזַן);
broadness. i.e. (concrete) the ear (from its form in man)
KJV: [phrase] advertise, audience, [phrase] displease, ear, hearing, [phrase] show.

H242.definition:
from H238 (אָזַן) and H7609 (שֶׁאֱרָה); plot of Sheerah (i.e. settled by him);
